# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4357
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%.25s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Since they are different users, they won't be reading/writing\n"
"the same ~/.xscreensaver file, so %s isn't\n"
"going to work right.\n"
"\n"
"You should either re-run %s as \"%s\", or re-run\n"
"xscreensaver as \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"%s körs som användare\"%s\"på värd\"%s\".\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-hanteringsskärmen \"%.25s\"\n"
"körs som användare\"%s\"på värd\"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Eftersom de är olika användare kommer de inte att läsa/skriva\n"
"samma ~/.xscreensaver-fil, alltså %s är det inte\n"
"kommer att fungera rätt.\n"
"\n"
"Du bör antingen köra om %s som \"%s\", eller kör igen\n"
"xscreensaver som \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"Starta om XScreenSaver-demonen nu?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4381
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is running as user \"%s\" on host \"%s\".\n"
"\n"
"If those two machines don't share a file system (that is,\n"
"if they don't see the same ~%s/.xscreensaver file) then\n"
"%s won't work right.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the daemon on \"%s\" as \"%s\" now?\n"
msgstr ""
"körs som användare \"%s\" på värd \"%s\".%s körs som användare \"%s\" på "
"värd \"%s\".\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-hanteringsskärmen \"%s\"\n"
"\n"
"%s kommer inte att fungera korrekt.Om dessa två datorer inte delar ett "
"filsystem (det vill säga,\n"
"om de inte ser samma ~%s/.xscreensaver-fil) då\n"
"\n"
"Starta om demonen på \"%s\" som \"%s\" nu?\n"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../driver/demo-Gtk.c:4402
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is %s version %s.\n"
"But the XScreenSaver managing display \"%s\"\n"
"is version %s.  This could cause problems.\n"
"\n"
"Restart the XScreenSaver daemon now?\n"
msgstr ""
"Detta är %s version %s.\n"
"Men XScreenSaver-hanteringsskärmen \"%s\"\n"
"är version %s.  Detta kan orsaka problem.\n"
"\n"
"Starta om XScreenSaver-demonen nu?\n"

