msgid "90 degree rotation speed"
msgstr "90 graders rotationshastighet"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/blitspin.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Repeatedly rotates an image by 90 degrees by using bitwise-logical\n"
"operations.\n"
"\n"
"The bitmap is divided into quadrants, and the quadrants are shifted\n"
"clockwise.  Then the same thing is done again with progressively\n"
"smaller quadrants, except that all sub-quadrants of a given size are\n"
"rotated in parallel.  As you watch it, the image appears to dissolve\n"
"into static and then reconstitute itself, but rotated.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 1992.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Roterar en bild upprepade gånger 90 grader med hjälp av bitvis-logisk\n"
"verksamhet.\n"
"\n"
"mindre kvadranter, förutom att alla delkvadranter av en given storlek är\n"
"roteras parallellt.  Bitmappen är uppdelad i kvadranter och kvadranter "
"skiftas\n"
"När du tittar på den verkar bilden lösas upp\n"
"medurs.  till statisk och sedan rekonstituera sig själv, men roteras.Sedan "
"görs samma sak igen med progressivt\n"
"\n"
"Skrivet av Jamie Zawinski; 1992.\n"
"  "

