#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:1
msgid "Epicycle"
msgstr "Epicykel"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:12
msgid "Harmonics"
msgstr "Övertoner"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A pre-heliocentric model of planetary motion.\n"
"\n"
"This draws the path traced out by a point on the edge of a\n"
"circle.  That circle rotates around a point on the rim of another\n"
"circle, and so on, several times.\n"
"\n"
"The geometry of epicycles was perfected by Hipparchus of Rhodes at some "
"time\n"
"around 125 B.C., 185 years after the birth of Aristarchus of Samos, the\n"
"inventor of the heliocentric universe model.  Hipparchus applied epicycles "
"to\n"
"the Sun and the Moon.  Ptolemy of Alexandria went on to apply them to what "
"was\n"
"then the known universe, at around 150 A.D.  Copernicus went on to apply "
"them\n"
"to the heliocentric model at the beginning of the sixteenth century.  "
"Johannes\n"
"Kepler discovered that the planets actually move in elliptical orbits in "
"about\n"
"1602.  The inverse-square law of gravity was suggested by Boulliau in 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newton's Principia Mathematica was published in 1687, and proved that\n"
"Kepler's laws derived from Newtonian gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Written by James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"En pre-heliocentrisk modell av planetarisk rörelse.\n"
"\n"
"Detta ritar vägen som spåras ut av en punkt på kanten av en\n"
"cirkel.  Cirkeln roterar runt en punkt på kanten av en annan\n"
"cirkel, och så vidare, flera gånger.\n"
"\n"
"Epicyklernas geometri perfekterades av Hipparchus från Rhodos någon gång\n"
"omkring 125 f.Kr., 185 år efter Aristarchus från Samos födelse,\n"
"uppfinnare av den heliocentriska universummodellen.  Hipparchus applicerade "
"epicyklar på\n"
"solen och månen.  Ptolemaios av Alexandria fortsatte med att tillämpa dem på "
"vad som var\n"
"sedan det kända universum, runt 150 e.Kr., fortsatte Copernicus med att "
"tillämpa dem\n"
"till den heliocentriska modellen i början av 1500-talet.  Johannes\n"
"Kepler upptäckte att planeterna faktiskt rör sig i elliptiska banor på "
"ungefär\n"
"1602. Den omvända kvadratiska gravitationslagen föreslogs av Boulliau 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newtons Principia Mathematica publicerades 1687 och bevisade det\n"
"Keplers lagar härrörde från Newtons gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Skrivet av James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "

