#: ../hacks/config/gibson.xml.h:16
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hacking the Gibson, as per the 1995 classic film, HACKERS.\n"
"\n"
"Cereal Killer: \"Oh yeah, you want a seriously righteous hack, you score\n"
"one of those Gibsons, man.  You know, supercomputers they use to like,\n"
"do physics, and look for oil and stuff?\"\n"
"\n"
"Phantom Phreak: \"Ain't no way, man, security's too tight. The big iron?\"\n"
"\n"
"Zero Cool: \"Maybe. But, if I were gonna hack some heavy metal, I'd, uh,\n"
"work my way back through some low security, and try the back door.\"\n"
"\n"
"Cereal Killer: \"Yeah but oh man, wouldn't you just love to get one of\n"
"those Gibsons, baby? Ooooh!\"\n"
"\n"
"Phantom Phreak: \"Yo, who ate all of my fries?\"\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski; 2020.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hacking the Gibson, enligt den klassiska filmen från 1995, HACKERS.\n"
"\n"
"Cereal Killer: \"Åh ja, du vill ha ett seriöst rättfärdigt hack, du gör mål\n"
"en av de där Gibsons, man.  Du vet, superdatorer som de brukar gilla,\n"
"gör fysik och letar efter olja och sånt?\"\n"
"\n"
"Phantom Phreak: \"Det går inte, man, säkerheten är för trång. Det stora "
"järnet?\"\n"
"\n"
"Zero Cool: \"Kanske. Men om jag skulle hacka lite heavy metal, skulle "
"jag...\n"
"arbeta mig tillbaka genom lite låg säkerhet och prova bakdörren.\"\n"
"\n"
"Cereal Killer: \"Ja men oh man, skulle du inte bara älska att få en av dem\n"
"de där Gibsons, älskling? Ooooh!\"\n"
"\n"
"Phantom Phreak: \"Yo, vem åt alla mina pommes frites?\"\n"
"\n"
"Skrivet av Jamie Zawinski; 2020.\n"
"  "

