# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/kallisti.xml.h:18
msgid ""
"\n"
"The golden apple of discord.\n"
"\n"
"Greek goddess Eris was not invited to a wedding; her retort was to toss in "
"a\n"
"golden apple, inscribed: \"to the fairest\".  Hera, Athena and Aphrodite\n"
"squabbled over it; Zeus noped out, telling Paris of Troy to decide. They "
"all\n"
"cheated, but Aphrodite won by letting Paris abduct and marry Helen of "
"Sparta.\n"
"The Greeks objected to this, leading to the Trojan War.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to launch a thousand ships? Because this is how you launch a\n"
"thousand ships.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Written by Jamie Zawinski and Jared Williams; 2024.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Oenighetens gyllene äpple.\n"
"\n"
"Den grekiska gudinnan Eris var inte inbjuden till ett bröllop; hennes replik "
"var att slänga in en\n"
"guldäpple, inskrivet: \"till de vackraste\".  Hera, Athena och Afrodite\n"
"bråkade om det; Zeus avbröt och sa till Paris av Troja att bestämma sig. De "
"alla\n"
"lurade, men Afrodite vann genom att låta Paris bortföra och gifta sig med "
"Helen av Sparta.\n"
"Grekerna motsatte sig detta, vilket ledde till det trojanska kriget.\n"
"\n"
"tusen fartyg.Vill du sjösätta tusen fartyg? För det är så här du startar en\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judgement_of_Paris\n"
"\n"
"Skrivet av Jamie Zawinski och Jared Williams; 2024.\n"
"  "

