# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/xanalogtv.xml.h:10
msgid ""
"\n"
"An old TV set, including artifacts like snow, bloom, distortion,\n"
"ghosting, and hash noise.  It also simulates the TV warming up. It\n"
"will cycle through 12 channels, some with images you give it, and some\n"
"with color bars or nothing but static.\n"
"\n"
"Written by Trevor Blackwell; 2003.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"En gammal TV, inklusive artefakter som snö, blomning, distorsion,\n"
"spökbilder och hash-brus.  Den simulerar också att TV:n värms upp. Det\n"
"kommer att gå igenom 12 kanaler, några med bilder du ger den, och några\n"
"med färgstaplar eller inget annat än statiskt.\n"
"\n"
"Skrivet av Trevor Blackwell; 2003.\n"
"  "

